<title>SINGAPORE: SIMEX Brent to trade on Thursday, fuel oil closed.</title>
<headline>SIMEX Brent to trade on Thursday, fuel oil closed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brent crude futures market on the Singapore International Monetary Exchange (SIMEX) will be open on Thursday, despite a national holiday in Singapore to mark Labour Day.</p>
<p>However, the SIMEX fuel oil market -- which follows Singapore's holiday calendar -- will be closed. It will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>SIMEX Brent will be closed on Monday, in line with a U.K. holiday.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
